{% block brandDescription %}
      <p class="brand-description">Founded in 1965 by aerospace engineer Charles Kaman, Ovation Guitars revolutionized acoustic guitars by incorporating helicopter-inspired design, utilizing a synthetic, rounded "Lyrachord" back for improved projection and durability. Known for pioneered electro-acoustic models with piezoelectric pickups, Ovation became a staple for live performers, blending traditional wood tops with modern materials.<br><a href="#" class="decoder-howto-link" data-modal-target="howto-ovation">(How to decode a Ovation serial #)</a></p>
